WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400
Find the truth values
height = 140; height &gt;= 140 is True; has_ticket is False
The boundary is included by &gt;=.

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:08.800
AND needs both
True AND False; Result: False
One False input prevents both inputs being True.

3
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:13.200
OR needs at least one
True OR False; Result: True
A single True input is enough for OR.

4
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:17.600
NOT reverses one value
NOT False; Result: True
NOT changes one truth value to its opposite.

5
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:22.000
Check the rules again
True AND True = True; False OR False = False; NOT True = False
Each line is an independent Boolean expression.
